    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d50-a3">

                <pb facs="0519" n="509" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv05/pg509"/>

                <head>Appendix III to IC–181G</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of Article 13 of Treaty of
                        London, Dated 26th April 1915</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Translation]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d50-f1"/></p>
                <p>In the event of France and Great Britain increasing their colonial territories in
                    Africa at the expense of Germany, those two Powers agree in principle that Italy
                    may claim some equitable compensation, particularly as regards the settlement in
                    her favor of the questions relating to the frontiers of the Italian colonies of
                    Eritrea, Somaliland and Libya and the neighboring colonies belonging to France
                    and Great Britain.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
